# Data Description

This project uses historical stock price data.

## Stocks Used
- Reliance Industries
- Power Grid Corporation
- NTPC
- HDFC Bank
- ICICI Bank

## Data Source
Data was collected from publicly available market sources (NSE india).

## Format
Each CSV file contains:
- Date
- Closing Price

## Note
The dataset is not included in this repository due to size and licensing constraints.

To run the project, place CSV files in this folder with the same filenames as used in `main.py`.
